orbiter (1.0.3-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Re-add keyboard grab retry so typing works when launched from a WM
    keybinding.
  * Guard against corrupt icon PNGs poisoning the cairo context, which froze
    all repaints after the first frame.
  * Depend on libxcb-util1 instead of the obsolete libxcb-aux0.

